<title>USA: Bally chmn to be named gambling prez at Hilton - WSJ.</title>
<headline>Bally chmn to be named gambling prez at Hilton - WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bally Entertainment Corp Chairman Arthur Goldberg will be named president of Hilton Hotels Corp gambling operations following approval of the $2.2 billion merger between the two companies, the Wall Street Journal reported Thursday.</p>
<p>Goldberg will also be named executive vice president of Hilton, the article said, citiing anonymous sources.</p>
<p>Hilton shareholders vote Thursday to approve the merger.</p>
<p>Goldberg would replace Floyd Celey in those positions. He was offered other jobs in the company but it was unclear what his move would be, the article said.</p>
</text>
